WEBVTT

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.960
Okay, let's take a break.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.330
Right.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.300
Is that you, Maya-chan?

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.140
I knew it!

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.870
Do you remember me?

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:45.850
It's me, Ami's dad!

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.980
Kuroki's father?

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:32.090
And so, I knocked out the boards on the roof!

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:33.340
And then what?

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:38.470
There were hundreds of talismans stuck
to the bottom of the roof!

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:40.550
Um, sir.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.960
I'm going home.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.990
I have a lot of work to do.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:46.420
Why?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:48.540
I'm almost at the good part.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.330
The secret of the red face
peeking into the room...

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.610
You don't want to hear it?

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.240
Good afternoon.

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.860
Hey, Maya-chan.

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:17.250
That was a great bath.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.430
Hey, Ami.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:21.600
I've got watermelon here.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.760
Awesome!

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.780
Man, the best part of summer is eating
watermelon on the porch.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.150
Hey, about Maya-chan...

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.250
Is she doing all right?

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:40.780
Yeah.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:42.200
I see.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:50.430
Yeah, I thought something was up.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.550
She's probably eating alone right now.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:00.510
Okay, then!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.370
<b>Kuroki Ami</b>

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.350
Hello?

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.320
Tomorrow?

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.040
Excuse us.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.200
Welcome!

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.080
Wow!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.940
My dad made them himself.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.110
They might not look it,
but they're delicious.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.370
Eat up.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.340
Your dad's working on a Sunday?

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.330
Sorry for the noise.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.970
No, it's okay.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:53.520
You haven't changed a bit.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.730
Reminds me of childhood.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:58.340
Hey, I know!

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:01.440
What was Maya like in elementary school?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:03.380
What's this about?

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.820
When you go to a friend's house

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:09.710
for the first time in years,
you have to talk about old times!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.830
I've got something interesting here.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:16.160
Read it, and you'll learn what
kind of kid she was.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.830
No!

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.170
Got it!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.610
Wait, Ami!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.050
Now, Kozue!

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.530
"What I want to be when I grow up."

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.100
Kumashiro Maya, Class 3-1.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.220
When I grow up, I want to go to Loch Ness,

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:39.400
in England, and catch the
Loch Ness monster!

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:42.230
Great, huh?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:46.490
When she was a kid, she loved the occult!

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.010
I was just ignorant.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:53.450
Even a kid who doesn't know any
better eventually grows up.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.320
I dunno.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:59.340
You should see what she wrote
when she was in fifth grade...

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:06.520
I'm going to have aliens take
me to Zeta Reticuli?

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.240
Don't read anymore!

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:12.320
They're having a lot of fun.

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.060
I have to keep working hard, too.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:23.070
I'm amazed you can eat so much.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.740
Why does a place like this
have pudding anyway?

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:30.980
And you always get the same thing.

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.070
I like this.

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:35.330
And I like pudding!

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:38.790
Hey!

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.050
Welcome, sensei.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:41.880
Hey?

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.510
Y-You guys...

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.090
Here's your usual.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.000
And a bonus.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.510
Thanks so much.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.910
Not at all.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.150
You want it?

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.290
Yahoo!

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.620
You're still going at it.

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.270
You guys are close.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.180
You're together on your day off.

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.870
We have a part-time job together.

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.880
Let's eat.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:34.050
Next up is a mystery circle found
in Matsushiro Nagano.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:38.270
That's filthy!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.750
Stop it!

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.380
Mystery circle?

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:46.500
As of last night, nothing unusual was seen,

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.770
which means that some party must have

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.670
created it between sundown
and early morning today.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:55.700
Prefectural police are investigating it
as some kind of foul trick.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:08:00.150
Look! It's a real mystery circle!

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:02.170
Why are you taking it seriously?

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.830
Even the news says it's fake.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:09.590
Sorry. I've gotta go.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.510
Maya.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:11.780
Maya-san?

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.510
I'm heading out.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.890
I'll come by again sometime.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:23.450
You're leaving already?

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.670
Yes. Goodbye.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.030
Hello?

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.440
Yeah, I saw it.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:40.580
What do you think?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.500
It's gotta be something!

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:45.550
Bye.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.000
I'll see you there.

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:50.670
Get in, Maya-chan.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.620
Sir!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:57.080
We're all going to see the mystery circle.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.230
Hurry up.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.640
You getting in or not?

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.790
What's wrong, Maya?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.040
What do you mean?

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.500
This mystery circle thing
is totally occult stuff.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:28.080
Is it okay for us to be riding in
the bed of a pickup truck?

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:32.250
Now's not the time for that.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:36.150
A mystery circle awaits us!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:41.180
All right then! Floor it, Daddy!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.760
I'm on it!

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:04.460
Look at the crowd!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:10.990
Well?

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:15.850
No good.

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:18.060
It's too early to give up.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:23.150
The UFO or alien that made
it might be the Key.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.970
You're right.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:28.640
The circle appeared between
last night and this morning.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:31.860
If a UFO's going to appear,
that's when it would.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.730
Let's stake it out, starting tonight.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:35.970
What?

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:40.110
No... I was thinking you're
really helpful today.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:43.450
No, that's not true...

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:54.540
Is something wrong?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.550
It's nothing.

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:07.030
What are you doing around here?

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:10.300
That teacher asked us to show him the way.

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:12.360
All right.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:14.880
There's still something I want you to do.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.650
Hang around until I call you.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.610
I'm tired.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.570
No whining!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.160
Get going!

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.510
Okay!

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:29.040
Then tonight... We can meet here, huh?

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.920
Yeah. As for the time...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.540
How about 10:00?

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:37.000
You're going to dinner now, right?

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:40.150
Then you can eat watermelon!

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.210
And then fireworks!

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.300
You guys aren't gonna...

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:46.920
Of course, we're coming with you.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:51.260
You can't really think we'd let you keep
something this fun to yourself.

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:52.890
You need a parental guardian.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.190
I guess we have no choice.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.900
Let's eat!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.860
Eat up!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.210
I love meat.

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.000
Why am I here?

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:36.180
Tamaya!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:38.190
Kagiya!

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.200
Aw, Dad, stop screwing around.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.340
They all fell asleep.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:09.680
I'll wake 'em up when it's time.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:17.690
I didn't think Maya'd be that 
interested in the mystery circle.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:24.220
It means she's still Maya-chan,
even after all that's happened.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.620
Hey, Dad.

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.660
Thanks.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.630
For doing all this for Maya.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:39.830
Aw, stop it.

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.820
Can it still take photos when it's this dark?

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:55.550
It's future technology. Believe in it.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.920
Some future technology.

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.460
Oh, right.

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:14.320
It's got a light for times like this.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.350
Um, which button was it?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.720
See?

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:20.790
It's light!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.530
A-A UFO!

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:34.540
You idiot!

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.710
You take a photo, too!

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:38.740
R-Right!

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:48.660
It's gone.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:50.990
Over there!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.980
How'd it get so far away?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:57.740
Hurry!

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.410
We'll lose it!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.090
Damn it.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.270
You suck.

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:10.650
Why are you taking a picture of the sky?

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:13.600
When it shakes this much, I can't do it right!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.780
See?

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:23.780
Slow down a bit.

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:27.900
Dad, right!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.800
It's the middle of the night!

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:38.320
There aren't gonna be any
other cars out here!

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.830
Right!

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:48.070
A-Ami-san's turned into an Ami-san
that I don't know...

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.720
Go! Go!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.840
Stop it!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.180
It's fine.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.590
My dad's the best driver in the country.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.020
Floor it, Daddy!

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:07.110
Right.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.570
No!

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:15.950
Go! Go!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.640
Left there.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:21.480
Right!

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:31.380
It's flying toward the academy.

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:36.840
Maybe this time,
it's really Nostradamus's Key.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:45.000
<b>Father Pastures</b>

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:45.020
Where are we?

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:54.840
What? It's just a cow.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:56.660
You get too scared.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.620
I'm from the city!

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.450
What is it this time?

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.800
What?

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:21.100
Is it dead?

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.110
This is...

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:24.250
What?

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.320
All the blood's been drained from its body.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.500
Is that...

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.540
Cattle mutilation.

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:40.850
Is this an alien's doing, too?

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:45.690
The UFO!

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.580
Look! Something's coming out.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:51.790
A grey...

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:54.010
A photo!

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:55.250
Wait a second!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:57.420
That's no alien I've ever seen.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.710
Just do it!

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:03.790
What's wrong?

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:06.040
I forgot to think about destroying it.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.100
What are you doing?

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:10.870
This is...

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.090
JK?

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:15.650
Th-They found us out.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.820
Wait a second...

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:19.410
Oh, crap!

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.910
Stop it!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.210
A balloon...

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:36.020
That's not it.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.930
What is he doing?

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:44.180
That screw-up.

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.270
Dad...

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:55.570
Kuroki's dad put you up to this?

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.720
And the mystery circle, too?

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.150
Yeah... He did.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.910
Then it was all fake...

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.480
What is this?

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:12.050
Dad, were you tricking us?

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:15.910
Sorry. I didn't mean anything by it.

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:18.490
Then why do it?

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:28.350
I just wanted to see Maya-chan
smiling and having fun.

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:33.520
Like she used to.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.790
And then what happened?

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.290
And then...

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:45.500
An old lady, wearing nothing but snowshoes,
came out from behind the telephone pole.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:50.540
Like this!

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:01.760
I heard you hate the occult now.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.990
Since your father died so suddenly,

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:06.220
and you started a new job as principal,

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.240
it's hard.

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:11.560
But the Maya-chan I knew couldn't
change that easily.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.020
I'm sure she's forcing herself.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:15.490
But even so...

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:18.440
Do you think it's okay to
do something like this?

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.240
As an adult, aren't you embarrassed?

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:26.500
We're serious about this!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:31.590
We... We don't have time to
be wasting on tricks-

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.770
Don't be mean to my father like that!

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:56.400
If you hate them, then spend the rest
of your life hating them!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.310
Ami.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:00.640
The occult! My dad!

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:04.700
Ami!

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:07.300
What?

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:20.170
Apologize to Maya-chan.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:27.980
Wait!

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:31.010
Wait, Ami-san!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.460
I'm sorry.

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:45.100
You thought it was the Key.

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:48.200
A bit, yeah.

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:51.480
So did I.

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:54.530
I thought maybe we could
change the future.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.410
But...

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:01.770
All of it was just for me.

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:50.570
Why do I have to do the preview?

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:51.600
It's your turn.

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:53.610
You do it. You're the star, right?

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:54.950
No whining. Do it.

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:56.030
No.

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:58.920
I won't let anyone say mean
things about my dad.

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:03.100
Calm down, you two. Have some of this.

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:04.120
What are you eating, Kozue?

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:06.330
Oh this?  It's a-

00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:08.050
Kozue!

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:10.740
Next time on <i>Occult Academy</i>:

00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:11.940
Mamma AMI~ya!

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:14.750
The next episode title is broken!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:19.800
This program is a work of fiction.
Departed spirits, psychic abilities,
aliens, UMAs, etc., do not exist.

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:19.800
Unless you believe in them...
